---
title: "SD-05 Merge Pull Request with Compare-and-Swap (UML Sequence Diagram)"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Developer
  participant API as api.PullsHandler
  participant P as pulls.Service
  participant Z as auth.Authorizer
  participant DB as store
  participant G as git.Repository
  participant EV as events.Bus

  U->>API: POST /pulls/7/merge {strategy, expected_head_sha}
  API->>P: Merge(ctx, actor, repo, 7, req)
  P->>Z: Require(actor, repo, Write)
  P->>DB: load PR, protection rule, required checks
  alt PR closed, head moved, or required checks not green
    P-->>API: errs.Conflict / errs.Forbidden
    API-->>U: 409 / 403 with reason
  end
  P->>G: ResolveCommit(main) → baseTip
  P->>G: MergeTree(baseTip, headSha)
  alt conflicts
    P-->>API: errs.Conflict(files)
    API-->>U: 409 conflict files
  end
  P->>G: CommitTree(tree, parents, message, author)
  Note right of G: merge → parents [baseTip, head]<br/>squash → parents [baseTip]
  G-->>P: newSha
  P->>G: UpdateRef(refs/heads/main, newSha, baseTip)
  alt main moved since baseTip
    G-->>P: errs.Conflict
    P-->>API: errs.Conflict
    API-->>U: 409 "base branch changed, retry"
  end
  P->>DB: Tx: merged_at, merged_by, merge_commit_sha, issue state=closed, system comment
  P->>EV: Publish(pull.merged) and Publish(git.push for main)
  P-->>API: Pull (merged)
  API-->>U: 200
